SmartSpend – Personal Expense Management System
SmartSpend is a full-stack web application that helps users track daily expenses, manage budgets, and gain insights into spending habits using visual analytics and smart budgeting suggestions.

Live Demo: https://smartspend-enpq.onrender.com

📌 Features:

🔐 Authentication
User Signup & Login
Session stored using Local Storage

💰 Expense Management
Add daily expenses
Delete transactions
View complete history

📊 Dashboard & Analytics
Total spending overview
Interactive doughnut chart (Chart.js)
Category-wise expense breakdown

📈 Budget Management
Set monthly budget
Track remaining balance
Visual feedback for overspending

🤖 Smart Suggestion(50-30-20 Rule)
Enter monthly income
Get AI-style budget suggestions:
50% Needs
30% Wants
20% Savings

📄 PDF Report Generation
Download full expense report
Includes:
User details
Total spend
Transaction table

🛠️ Tech Stack:

Frontend
HTML5
CSS3
JavaScript (Vanilla)
Chart.js
jsPDF

Backend
Node.js
Express.js

Database
MongoDB Atlas

Deployment
Render (Full-stack hosting)
